            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>From the World Congress on Inflammation, held August 20-24, 2005 in Melbourne, Australia, new targets and new drugs for inflammation of the respiratory system (asthma, allergic rhinitis, chronic obstructive pulmonary disease and cystic fibrosis), inflammatory bowel disease (ulcerative colitis and Crohn's disease), arthritis (rheumatoid and osteoarthritis), atherosclerosis and cancer are discussed.</AbstractText>
